- **`app/main.py`** — `GET /tasks` now accepts optional query params `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` (combinable), plus `page` (default 1) and `page_size` (default 20). Filters apply before slicing.

- **`POST /tasks`** — Requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`. Validates `project_id` exists against the `projects` list (404 if not). Auto-generates the next unique integer ID, appends the task, and returns it with status 201.

- **`PUT /tasks/{task_id}`** — Requires auth. Uses `TaskUpdate.model_fields_set` to update only the fields explicitly provided (true partial update). Returns 404 if the task doesn't exist.

- **`DELETE /tasks/{task_id}`** — Requires auth. Removes the task and returns 204. Returns 404 if not found.

